  "review": "Shop/vault navigation reuses shared Qt host and existing exact-source models, focusing original enemy/reward in matching ancestor or retaining a child stage page. Source context retains identity, declared floor and target; dependent pages expire on actual context change. Identical reference refresh skips control/text rebuilding and retains reading. Repeated signal-blocking try/finally uses scoped QSignalBlocker. Pinned PyQtDarkTheme static QSS/SVG/full palettes add a scoped reference variant without changing the application palette or light baseline. Fixed-map margins inherit owned palette; original terrain/markers/projection unchanged. Existing inventory selector-specific background is aligned to its declared palette. Exact presentation copy rules shorten all shop topics; pickup/recovery conditions, numeric limits and concise source conflicts remain, originals stay in details. No new catches, retries or private persistence.",
  "whole_program_review_complete": false
}
